{{Zones}}

This article is a list of all '''zones by level''' before ''[[World of Warcraft: Cataclysm]]''.

*Colors indicate <span style="background-color:#000033; padding:4px">Alliance territory</span>, <span style="background-color:#330000; padding:4px">Horde territory</span>, <span style="background-color:#333300; padding:4px">Contested territory</span>, <span style="background-color:#003300; padding:4px">Combat zone</span>.
*Numbers within the bars indicate the level range.
*{{Bc-inline}} and {{Wotlk-inline}} indicate the required expansion.
*({{RaceIcon|Unknown}} only) indicates the zone is instanced, and thus exclusive, for that [[race]] or [[hero class]].
*These are accurate to the following [[Classic]]s: {{expac|Burning Crusade Classic}} and {{expac|Wrath of the Lich King Classic}}.

